  m_text: 'Collect electric eels to prevent electric shocks.


    Grab the ladder
    and climb onto the boat before the flood!


    Complete the parkour inside the
    whale to find a whistlefish.


    Collect 3 whistlefish by completing the parkour
    3 times to finish the game!'
